  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is",
